🇺🇸 English Version
Android Kernel (OPPO sm8250) - Gamepad Driver Backport
This repository is a modified Linux 4.19 kernel for OPPO sm8250 devices. It is forked from youngguo18/android_kernel_OPPO_sm8250 (stock/13.1).

The primary goal of this fork is to backport modern gamepad drivers from the Linux 6.6 kernel (sm8750) to this Linux 4.19 kernel, bringing native support for modern controllers like the PS5 DualSense.

📝 Key Changes & Modified Files
drivers/hid/hid-playstation.c: Backported from Linux 6.6 to support PS5 DualSense and PS4 DualShock 4 controllers.

Note: The multicolor LED subsystem support was removed/stubbed to maintain compatibility and pass compilation on the 4.19 kernel.

drivers/hid/hid-sony.c: Removed legacy DS4 support (this is now handled entirely by the new hid-playstation.c driver to prevent conflicts).

drivers/hid/hid-microsoft.c & drivers/hid/hid-nintendo.c: Updated/backported for better Xbox and Nintendo controller support.

drivers/Kconfig: Updated to include the new driver configurations.

arch/arm64/configs/vendor/kona-perf_defconfig & build.sh: Build scripts and configurations updated.

🛡️ KernelSU (KSU) Notice
The original upstream repository had KernelSU built-in and enabled by default. In this fork, the KSU compilation options have been disabled in the config. The KSU source code still remains in the directory tree, so you can easily re-enable it in the defconfig if needed.

🛠️ Toolchain Setup
Before building, clone the required LineageOS prebuilt toolchains into your ~/kernel directory:

Bash
mkdir -p ~/kernel
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_clang_kernel_linux-x86_clang-r416183b.git ~/kernel/clang
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_aarch64_aarch64-linux-android-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc64
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_arm_arm-linux-androideabi-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc32
🚀 Build Instructions
Once the toolchains are downloaded, simply run the build script:

Bash
bash build.sh
🇨🇳 中文版本 (Chinese Version)
安卓内核 (OPPO sm8250) - 现代游戏手柄驱动移植版
本项目是一个针对 OPPO sm8250 设备的定制版 Linux 4.19 内核。源代码 Fork 自 youngguo18/android_kernel_OPPO_sm8250 (stock/13.1)。

本仓库的主要目的是将 Linux 6.6 内核 (sm8750) 中最新的游戏手柄驱动，向下移植 (Backport) 到 Linux 4.19 内核中，为手机带来原生的现代手柄（如 PS5 DualSense）底层级支持。

📝 核心修改与文件说明
drivers/hid/hid-playstation.c: 从 6.6 内核移植，提供对 PS5 (DualSense) 和 PS4 (DualShock 4) 手柄的支持。

注：由于 4.19 内核缺少对应的基础子系统，为保证顺利编译，移除了多色 LED (Multicolor LED) 的注册逻辑，保留了手柄底层默认蓝灯。

drivers/hid/hid-sony.c: 移除了原有的 DS4 支持代码（现已交由 hid-playstation.c 全权接管，以防止驱动冲突）。

drivers/hid/hid-microsoft.c & drivers/hid/hid-nintendo.c: 同步更新移植，优化 Xbox 和任天堂手柄的支持。

drivers/Kconfig: 更新了 HID 驱动菜单的配置项。

arch/arm64/configs/vendor/kona-perf_defconfig & build.sh: 编译脚本与配置文件更新。

🛡️ 关于 KernelSU (KSU) 的说明
原仓库默认内置并开启了 KernelSU。为了保持内核纯净，本分支在配置文件中禁用了 KSU 的编译选项。不过，KSU 的源代码仍完整保留在代码树中，如果你需要 Root 权限，可以自行在 defconfig 文件中重新开启它。

🛠️ 编译工具链准备
在开始编译之前，请先将 LineageOS 提供的预编译工具链克隆到你的 ~/kernel 目录下：

Bash
mkdir -p ~/kernel
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_clang_kernel_linux-x86_clang-r416183b.git ~/kernel/clang
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_aarch64_aarch64-linux-android-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc64
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_arm_arm-linux-androideabi-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc32
🚀 编译方法
工具链下载完成后，在源码根目录直接运行编译脚本即可：

Bash
bash build.sh
